2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/Galicia.htm#EnderquinaMenendezMGundesindoEriz
2 CONT
2 CONT HERMENEGILDO Gutiérrez, son of GUTIERRE - & his wife Elvira - (-after 912).  … m ERMESINDA Gatóniz, daughter of GATÓN Ramírez & his wife Egilona -
2 CONT
2 CONT Hermenegildo Gutiérrez & his wife had [six] children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. '''ENDERQUINA''' Menéndez "Pala" (-before [947]). Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by a charter dated 21 Feb 897 which records that "Gondesindus prolis Erus et Adosinda" accepted as his wife "Enderquina conmento Pala fi
2 CONC lia dux Menemdus Gutierizi et Ermesinda iermana de domna Geluira regina que fuit mulier de Ordonius rex mater Ranemirus principe", names their children "filius…Suarius, Ermesinda et Adosinda et Froilo…cum infirmidate nata", record
2 CONC s his foundation of churches "inter Durio et Uauga in villa Acibeto…in villa Sanganeto…", and that he committed "filia mea Froilo" to "domna Geluira abatisisa"[347].
2 CONT
2 CONT m GUNDESINDO Eriz, son of conde ERO Fernández & his first wife Aldonza -- (-after [947]).
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/Galicia.htm#GundesindoErizd947MEnderquinaMenendez
2 CONT
2 CONT GUNDESINDO Eriz, son of ERO Fernández & his first wife Adosinda - (-after [947]). … m ENDERQUINA Menéndez "Pala", daughter of HERMENEGILDO Gutiérrez & his wife Ermesenda Gatóniz (-before [947]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gundesindo & his wife had five children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         SUERO Gundesíndez (-before 964).  … m JIMENA, daughter of -- (-before 981).
2 CONT 2.         ERMESENDA Gundesíndez (-after [947]).  …
2 CONT 3.         ADOSINDA Gundesíndez (-after [947]). … She married against the wishes of her father[781].  m ANSUR Benfrogia . 
2 CONT 4.         FRUELA Gundesindez (-after 26 Sep 942). …
2 CONT 5.         ERO Gundesíndez (-after 26 Sep 942). …
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
