2 CONT
2 CONT Urraca of Zamora, Infanta of Castile. Ruler of the city Zamora.  Sancho II of Castile (1040s - 1067). First son.  Elvira of Toro, Infanta of Castile. Ruler of the city Toro.  Alfonso VI of Castile (1040s - July 1, 1109). Second so
2 CONC n.  García II of Galicia and Portugal (1040s - 1090s). Third son.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sancha of León (1013 – 27 November 1067) was a daughter of Alfonso V of Leon by Elvira Mendes and Queen consort of Castile. She married Ferdinand I of León in 1032. She was a devout Catholic.
2 CONT
2 CONT She had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Urraca of Zamora, Infanta of Castile. Ruler of the city Zamora. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sancho II of Castile (1040s - 1067). First son. 
2 CONT
