2 CONT * http://www.asbrap.org.br/documentos/revistas/rev24_art4.pdf
2 CONT * https://charters.one-name.net/p445.htm
2 CONT * https://repositorio.ul.pt/bitstream/10451/23960/1/ulfl200608_tese.pdf
2 CONT
