1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lope I Díaz de Haro''', IV Señor de Vizcaya (c. 1105 - May 6, 1170)
2 CONT
2 CONT Llamado «el Rubio» o «el de Nájera»
2 CONT
2 CONT Fue el IV señor de Vizcaya entre los años 1124 y 1170
2 CONT
2 CONT The fourth Lord of Biscay (from at least 1162). 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was an important magnate in Castile during the reign of the Emperor Alfonso VII and in the kingdom of his son and grandson. Between 1147 and 1168 he is recorded as governing Old Castile on behalf of the crown.
2 CONT
