2 CONT Menéndez Pidal de Navascués, Faustino (1982). Luis de Salazar y Castro Institute, ed. Spanish Medieval Heraldry . Volume I: The Royal House of Castile and Leon. Nobility. ISBN  8400051505 .
2 CONT Pardo de Guevara y Valdés, Eduardo ; Eduardo José Pardo, Padre Sarmiento Institute of Galician Studies (2000). Pedro Barrié de la Maza Foundation, ed. The lords of Galicia: lieutenants and counts of Lemos in the Middle Ages: Histo
2 CONC rical Galicia (1st edition). ISBN  84-89748-71-3 .
