2 CONT Diego G to Constance Blount (wife of John Sutton) is found both inWeis/Sheppard, and in a Rubincam article in NGSQ in the '50s or so.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ricardo Izquierdo Benito, ed., _Privilegios Reales otorgados a Toledo
2 CONT durante la Edad Media (1101-1494)_ (Toledo: Instituto Provincial de
2 CONT Investigaciones y Estudios Toledanos; Diputacion Provincial de Toledo,
2 CONT 1990), contains a document (no. 107, pp. 207-211), dated 27 March 1375 at
2 CONT Alcala de Henares, in which Enrique II confirms an exchange of property
2 CONT between Diego Gomez de Toledo and his aunt Constanza, on one part, and a
2 CONT group of other individuals, on the other. The exchange deals with a
2 CONT renegotiation or execution of a testamentary settlement of Fernan Gomez de
2 CONT Toledo. In this document, twice, Diego Gomez de Toledo clearly calls
2 CONT himself son of Gomez Perez:
2 CONT
2 CONT "et yo Diego Gomez alcallde mayor de Toledo fijo de don Gomes Peres ..."
2 CONT
2 CONT This resolves the debate over the paternity of Diego Gomez.
2 CONT [Custer February 1, 2002 Family Tree.FTW]
2 CONT
