1 OCCU "Era doncel del rey Pedro I de Castilla, vasallo y fiel servidor de Enrique II y camarero mayor de Enrique III." Ver fuente: SoloGenealogía.  Fernando foi o sucessor na Casa de seu pai, em Sevilha.  Foi Alcaide dos castelos de Cam
2 CONC bil e de Alhabar, e Fron
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "He was a servant of King Peter (Pedro) I of Castile, vassal and faithful servant of Henry II and chief waiter of Henry III." 
2 CONT See source: SoloGeneaología. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Fernando was the successor in his country's House, in Seville. He was Warden of two castles in Cambil and Alhabar, and Fronteiro-mor against the walls of Granada. When I was young, I was the servant of Pedro I (your children were 
2 CONC sons of Rico-homens, great cavaleiros, raised from childhood in the Chamber of the King and, for their fidelity, formed a personal guard of the king in battles). Later, he passed the party of the Count of Trastamara (future Henriq
2 CONC ue II), who in 1369 won the battle of Campos de Montiel. 
