2 CONC a domna Elvira, Mari Petriz, Milia Petriz” conferred rights on San Juan de Tardajos by charter dated 31 Jan 1147[1061].  Alférez of Alfonso VII King of Castile Mar 1145 to 4 Feb 1155.  "Aldefonsus…tocius Hyspanie imperator…cum uxo
2 CONC re mea imperatrice domna Rica et…filiis meis Sanctio et Ferrando regibus" donated property to the abbey of Silos by charter dated 28 Oct 1155, confirmed by "…Nunnus Petriz tenens Montor…"[1062].  Conde 11 Mar 1162.  The Annales Co
2 CONC mpostellani record the capture in 1177 of Cuenca and the death there “III Non Aug” of “Comes Nunius”[1063].  The Anales Toledanos record the death in Jun 1177 of “el Conde D. Nuño”[1064]. 
