2 CONC emarus filius ducis Abel" was captured by soldiers of the archbishop of Köln "a scolis Parisiis domum pergens"[752].  He succeeded in 1254 as Duke of Sønderjylland [Schleswig].  The Annales Ryenses record the death in 1257 of "Wal
