1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [Medlands] Infanta doña SANCHA de Navarra (1148-1176).  Rodrigo de Toledo records that "Rex Garsias tertiam filiam…Sanciam" married "Gastoni vicecomiti Bearnensi", that the couple died childless and that she marrie
2 CONC d secondly "Petro comiti Molinensi" by whom she had "filium…Aimericum qui fuit vicecomes Narbonensis"[530].  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos records that "Conde D. Pedro de Molina" married "D. Sancha"[531].  "Comes Petru
2 CONC s et ele Infant uxor sua Santia" donated "medietate Salinarum" to Huerta San Martín by charter dated "Era 1240" (presumably mis-dated)[532].  m firstly ([1165]) GASTON [V] Vicomte de Béarn, son of PIERRE Vicomte de Béarn [Gavaret]
2 CONC  & his wife Ataresa --- (-1170).  m secondly (1173) as his first wife, conde don PEDRO Manrique de Lara Vicomte de Narbonne, son of conde don MANRIQUE Pérez de Lara & his wife Ermesinde Ctss de Narbonne (-Jan 1202, bur Santa María
2 CONC  de Huerta).  Mayordomo mayor of don Fernando II King of León 11 Feb 1185.  
